cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CortexProbe: synthetic receptive field fitting and grouped validation"
message: "If you use CortexProbe, cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: urme
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/urmeo/cortexprobe"
abstract: >-
  Gaussian receptive field fitting with synthetic moving apertures, grouped
  validation and local parameter uncertainty. Validation uses synthetic responses;
  no neural network or human data has been tested.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - population-receptive-field
  - retinotopy
  - vision
